<title>SPAIN: Spain's Alba 9-mth net profit 4.9 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Alba 9-mth net profit 4.9 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish holding company Corporacion Financiera Alba said on Wednesday its consolidated net profit for the first nine months of 1996 to end September rose to 4.9 billion pesetas from 4.3 billion pesetas in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it would distribute a gross interim dividend of 60 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>Alba provided no further information.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2171</p>
</text>
